<title>UK: Credit Local sets 100 mln euro December 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 100 mln euro December 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Banque Internationale a Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN EURO  COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    23.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.72    PAY DATE  S-06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2002 AND 2003 OATS</p>
<p> NOTES	CCB IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>		PAYABLE IN ECU UNTIL THIRD STAGE OF EMU</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
